 "notes": "Thompson Heights Avenue: THOMPSON HEIGHTS is lettered in street style along the diagonal street from Glen Parker Avenue north-east to West View Avenue, and the same street continues east past East View Avenue where only AVENUE is printed (about x 7100); taken as one street. Glen Armand Avenue and Janet Street meet as an L corner. Otte Street (west) and Glen Armand Avenue (east) meet Hamilton about 30 px apart. Glen Parker Avenue is printed west of Hamilton (name about x 3100-3300, y 1950) and again north-east of Hamilton; its two arms meet Hamilton about 150 px apart, recorded as two T junctions. Glen Parker x Thompson Heights is a wide irregular opening; the point is the middle of the opening. Bruce Avenue: BRUCE printed far west (about x 2550, y 3340), AVENUE printed east of Hamilton; the two arms are offset about 35 px at Hamilton (west arm centre 5095,3109; east arm 5109,3142), recorded as one cross. The ? at x about 3730-3830 (at Bruce, Westmoreland, Howland Place, Pullan, Ella, Chase) is one north-south avenue printed only AVE. (about 3745,3760), no name found. Pitts: PITTS lettered in the street running south from Chase at x about 3698, suffix not seen; it meets Chase about 40 px west of the unnamed avenue from the north. Pullan Avenue east of Hamilton (to Haight Avenue) has no printed name within reach; taken as Pullan continuing. Addingham: ADDINGHAM printed, suffix read as P(lace) where the street turns north at about x 6330. The ? at Witler Street (3942,5883) is an east-west street printed only ST. Haight Avenue ends at Pullan Avenue (east). Hamilton x Chase is at the plate bottom edge; kind uncertain. Unnamed 15 ft alley runs south-south-west from Glen Armand Avenue at about x 4565; not recorded. | Otte Street and Glen Armand Avenue meet Hamilton as an offset pair (18 px apart). THOMPSON HEIGHTS is lettered inside the diagonal street between West View Avenue and Glen Parker Avenue with no suffix printed; used as its name. West View Avenue, that diagonal and the unnamed east-west street at y 858 (at the foot of East View Avenue) meet in one open junction; the pick is its middle. Glen Parker Avenue is lettered west of Hamilton (y 1920) and on the diagonal east of it; the two arms meet Hamilton about 75 px apart (4090,1884 and 4152,1930), recorded as one cross at the middle; the east-west AVE. at y 1373 is taken as its continuation. Bruce Avenue: name printed far west (x 2550); west arm meets Hamilton at 5098,3107 and the east arm (lettered AVENUE, running to Haight) at 5110,3140, recorded as one cross. Haight Avenue: the straight run continues south-east past Bruce to Addingham and Donaldson Place, where only AVE. is printed. Addingham: suffix not seen. The street east of Hamilton opposite Pullan is unnamed in view (taken as Pullan Avenue); suffixes of Pullan, Chase and Hamilton are not printed in the strip. Chase name printed at x 2050; it runs along the bottom neat line, centre taken as y 5303-5306. The ? at x 3716-3817 is an unnamed north-south AVE. (label at 3740,3750) from Bruce Avenue down to Chase Avenue; the ? x ? at 3803,4308 is an unnamed street entering it from the west. The ? at Witler (3939,5872) is a ST. whose name lies west of x 3700. Not streets: 30 ft strip (lot 6) south of Otte at x 3870; 50 ft fenced strip north of Haight at x 5300; 27 inch sewer line east of Haight at y 2850; lot lines south of the North Argyle loop."
